<concept id="d258aA" xml:lang="en">
   <title>Save Action</title>
   <prolog>
      <author>Rakesh Singh</author>
      <critdates>
         <created date="Dec 14, 2023"/>
      </critdates>
      <metadata>
         <prodinfo>
            <prodname>X-Author for Excel</prodname>
         </prodinfo>
      </metadata>
   </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>A Save Action pushes Excel workbook data into your environment based on a Save Map.</p>
      <note type="note">
         <p>To create a Save Action, you must have an existing <xref href="../working_with_save_maps_98_98667692/98667692.dita"
                  format="dita">Save Map</xref>.</p>
      </note>
   </conbody>
</concept>
